  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nThe given expression = (48.3×[(4.95)²+4.95×13.25])/([(12.55)²-(5.65)²]×19.8) \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(48.3×[(4.95)²+4.95×13.25])/([(12.55)²-(5.65)²]×19.8) \n\n= (48.3×4.95(4.95+13.25))/([(12.55+5.65)(12.55-5.65)]×19.8) \n\n= (48.3×4.95×18.20)/(18.20×6.9×19.8)\n\n= (48.3×4.95×18.20)/(18.20×6.9×19.8) = (48.3×4.95)/(6.9×19.8)\n\n= (7 × 4.95)/19.8\n\n= 35/20\n\n= 1.75\n\n**∴ The value of the given expression is 1.75**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/0a6c2db12945bba9d674d33112fce66b07f00093d75dae93749f9bdb7bd34e7a.png] **__Hint__**since all the options are distinct, we can approximate the values\n\n⇒ (49 × 5)/(7 × 20) = 7/4 = 1.75\n\n3b:T744,\n<p&g",
